<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n74385" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ητος</span>, ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sharpness, pointedness,</i> of acute angles, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Ti.</u>
				61e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				56d
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of the
			senses, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>1.</b> of sound,
				<i>sharpness,</i> opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βαρύτης,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Phlb.</u>
				17c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Tht.</u>
				163c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of taste,
				<i>pungency, acidity,</i> in pl., <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>VM</u>
				19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Acut.</u>
				61
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				11.656
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b> of sight,
				<i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				492a4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> metaph.,
				<i>sharpness, cleverness,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς ψυχῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Rh.</u>
					2.31
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				S.
			</span></i> ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκέψεως</span> ibid.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφέροντα τῇ τέχνῃ τῇ τ᾽
			ὀξύτητι</span> Philosteph. Com.I; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀ. ἐς τὰ πολιτικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Luc.
					<u>Im.</u>
					17
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>quickness,</i> of motion, action, or occurrence, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				37
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Chrm.</u>
				160b
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Plt.</u>
				306c
			</span></i>, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῖς ὀξύτησι . . ἀκολουθεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					24.95
				</span></i>
			 ; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ ὀ. τοῦ καιροῦ</span> the
				<i>pressing</i> occasion, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Pyrrh.</u>
				2
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				15.43
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			=
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξεῖα, ἡ,</span>
			
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀξύς</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				11.3d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				138.16
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Po.</u>
				1456b33
			</span></i> : pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Cra.</u>
				399a
			</span></i>.</div>
